    <blockquote>“Start where you are with what you have. Just don’t let money and time be the excuse.”</blockquote>
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem)">Hi, I’m so glad you’re here</h1>
      <p>I didn’t come to health from a place of having it all together. I came to it from rock bottom: addiction, an unsafe relationship, and years of shame. A brain scan showed me it wasn’t just a moral failure, and that gave me hope.</p>
      <p>I did the work and healed, but I walked away frustrated that real healing is so expensive and so hard to find. So now I share what I’ve learned, from milling our own flour and cooking in my great-grandmother’s cast iron to clearing out the hidden things in our homes that add up.</p>
      <p>We’re an ingredient family. We try to be a Mary, not a Martha. And none of this matters without Jesus.</p>
